 To apply a Gaussian filter before the Sobel edge detection in MATLAB, you can use the `imgaussfilt` function to smooth the image and then apply the Sobel operator as you've done before. Here's the modified code:
```
% Read input image and convert to grayscale
input_image = imread('image.jpg');
